"""
ArrAttack (Adaptive Robust Rewriting) Attack Runner

This script implements the ArrAttack method from Li et al. (2025).
ArrAttack uses an LLM to rewrite malicious prompts in diverse ways, evaluates
candidates against defense mechanisms using a robustness judge, and selects
prompts resistant to target defenses.

Output: results/arrattack/<dataset>/<victim>.csv
Schema: prompt, category, attempt, time, rewritten_prompt, victim_response, success
"""

